                "title": "Oracle License, Support & Maintenance",
                "description": "This is a Contract Award Notice.\r\n\r\nThe Care Quality Commission (CQC) require the services of the annual Oracle Technical Support and Maintenance to support the delivery of the CRM system.\r\n\r\nThis procurement was undertaken following the Single tender action (below threshold) negotiated procedure without prior publication.  \r\n\r\nCompetition is absent for technical reasons inline with The Public Contracts Regulations 2015, Regulation 32. (2b) (ii).\r\n\r\nThe Contract is awarded for a total period of 6 months.\r\n\r\nTotal Awarded Value is maximum of all charges including any optional contract extensions.          \r\n\r\nContract Reference: CQC I&D 096\r\n\r\nUpdated 23.04.2024 - Text to be corrected in the original notice where incorrect data field responses were displayed:\r\nSection name: Contract Summary\r\nPlace of Text to be corrected: Procedure type\r\nInstead of: Single tender action (below threshold)\r\nRead: Negotiated procedure without prior publication (above threshold)",
